Z||000006||88 Database Nut||03-27-2001||08:09 AM||||DEFINATELY buy it!  Do check the title out,<BR>with carfax I guess, but even if it's a salvage title, you can sell the parts for 3 or 4 times what you'll pay for it.  If you care to, send me the VIN and the colors for my '88 database project.  Also, since it's got ttops (does it have the "CJB" code on the data block under the hood?), Ray Paulk of the TTOP registry would be thrilled to have some info on it.  goto <A HREF="http://www.fierottop.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fierottop.com</A>  and you can enter the VIN and check your car.  He may even have some good info about it he can share with you.  GOOD LUCK!||||reg||1
